window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Welcome to the Exiled Sector, home to the most lethal Alphas on the planet. These beings don't play nice with others. They've been banished. And a plane full of Omegas just crashed-landed on their isles.</b></p> <p>We're being hunted. Their feral growls follow us. Their howls haunt us. Their knots call to us. And their savagery terrifies us.</p> <p>Some will escape. Some will be caught. Three will be claimed.</p> <p>My name is Caja. And this is the story of how an Alpha named Enrique saved me from the horrors of Bariloche Sector.</p> <p>Only to end up crash-landing our plane on Venom Island…</p> <p><i>The Exiled Sector series features three fast-paced, action-packed, standalone romance books. Each story guarantees a happily-ever-after ending and can be enjoyed in any order.</i></p>"; 
